From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:16:37 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: extensions list in the settings window

Settings > Extensions now lists every installed extension, each with an info icon (description, version and author) and an Open button that runs it, or Close while it runs, as its View menu entry does. VLCSettings loads the extensions on first use and refreshes the list when they change. Add-ons and VLC's plugins stay behind the Manage button, which opens the old dialog.
---
