 .../qt/dialogs/dialogs/qml/SettingsRow.qml    | 14 +++-
 .../qt/dialogs/preferences/vlc_settings.cpp   | 80 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../qt/dialogs/preferences/vlc_settings.hpp   | 10 +++
 4 files changed, 113 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

